  "summary": "Apache Tomcat: Possible TLS 1.3 connection failures",
  "details": "Incomplete cleanup vulnerability in Apache Tomcat could cause TLS 1.3 connections to fail intermittently.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0 through 11.0.26, from 10.1.25 through 10.1.60, from 9.0.90 through 9.0.122.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.27, 10.1.61 or 9.0.123, which fix the issue.",
